+		IOLog("SWEET SURF: %s create id %u %ux%u fmt 0x%x bpe %u bpr %u planes %u size %u keys %u%s%s%s -> 0x%x\n",
 		    name, s->id, s->width, s->height, s->pixelFormat, s->bytesPerElement,
-		    s->bytesPerRow, s->planeCount, s->allocSize, props->getCount(), s->wrapped ? " (wraps the caller's memory)" : "", ret);
+		    s->bytesPerRow, s->planeCount, s->allocSize, props->getCount(), s->wrapped ? " (wraps the caller's memory)" : "",
